<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Submit an Experience | Heralds of the Lion</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/experience-submit.css">
</head><body>
<div class="paper"><div class="stamp">UNREVIEWED</div>
<header class="header"><p class="eyebrow">EXPERIENCE ARCHIVE · PUBLIC INTAKE</p><h1>SUBMIT AN EXPERIENCE</h1><p class="intro">Describe what you experienced as carefully as possible. The Order records the report before attempting interpretation. Submission does not imply endorsement, validation, or a paranormal conclusion.</p></header>
<% if (error) { %><div class="form-message error"><%= error %></div><% } %>
<form action="/experiences/submit" method="POST">
<section class="section"><h2>I · The Event</h2><label>Date of experience</label><input type="date" name="dateOfExperience"><label>Approximate time</label><input type="text" name="approximateTime" placeholder="e.g. around 03:00 / evening / unknown"><label>Location</label><input type="text" name="location" placeholder="City, region, site or 'withheld'"><label>Country</label><input type="text" name="country"><label>Age band at time of experience</label><select name="ageBand"><option value="">Prefer not to say</option><option>UNDER_18</option><option>18_24</option><option>25_34</option><option>35_44</option><option>45_54</option><option>55_64</option><option>65_PLUS</option></select></section>
<section class="section"><h2>II · State & Observation</h2><label>State of consciousness</label><select name="stateOfConsciousness"><option value="">Not specified</option><option>AWAKE</option><option>FALLING_ASLEEP</option><option>WAKING</option><option>DREAM</option><option>ALTERED_STATE</option><option>UNKNOWN</option></select><label>Raw narrative</label><textarea name="rawNarrative" rows="14" required minlength="30" maxlength="25000" placeholder="Describe what happened in your own words. Separate what you directly perceived from what you later concluded where possible."></textarea><label>Your interpretation, if any</label><textarea name="witnessInterpretation" rows="4" placeholder="Optional. Example: 'I interpreted the figure as...' This is stored separately from the raw narrative."></textarea></section>
<section class="section"><h2>III · Structured Features</h2><p class="small">Select only features that were actually present. These are research classifications, not explanations.</p><div class="feature-grid"><% taxonomy.forEach(feature => { %><label class="feature"><input type="checkbox" name="features" value="<%= feature.code %>"><span><strong><%= feature.label %></strong><small><%= feature.category %></small></span></label><% }) %></div></section>
<section class="section"><h2>IV · Privacy & Publication</h2><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="anonymous" value="true" checked> Preserve this submission as anonymous by default.</label><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="publicConsent" value="true"> I consent to a reviewed, redacted version being considered for the public Experience Archive or The Bell.</label><p class="small">Unreviewed submissions are never automatically published. This form currently does not collect direct contact information; follow-up contact will be introduced separately from the research record.</p></section>
<input class="honeypot" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"><button class="submit-btn" type="submit">ENTER INTO THE ARCHIVE</button></form>
<p class="back"><a href="/archive">← Return to the Archive</a></p></div>
</body></html>
